# Branch naming

Cloudflare Workers preview aliases accept only lowercase letters, digits, `-`, and `_`
(max 63 chars). A branch name containing `/` is rejected server-side with
`invalid alias: … [code: 10021]`, so slashes are banned here.

## Format

    <prefix>-<short-slug>

- Lowercase `[a-z0-9-]` only. No `/`, no `_`, no spaces, no uppercase.
- Keep under 63 characters.

## Prefixes

| Prefix | Use |
|--------|-----|
| `brand-` | Taste experiments run by `brand-iterate` |
| `site-` | Mechanical site work — links, redirects, assets, ASC URL wiring |
| `fix-` | Bug fixes |
| `chore-` | Tooling, config, docs |

Good: `brand-home-product-copy`, `site-redirect-cleanup`, `chore-workers-assets-config`

Bad: `brand/home-product-copy`, `feature/bar`, `Fix_Nav`, `my branch`

## Notes

- Branches created before this rule (`brand/…`) stay as they are; do not rename them.
- Every non-production branch push triggers a Workers preview build (`wrangler versions upload`),
  which never promotes to production.
- **Do not push or merge to `main` without explicit user approval.**
